| Prop | Type | Default | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| `title` | `string` | `"New project"` | The header title; also the form's accessible name. |
| `urlPrefix` | `string` | `"edgeline.app/"` | The fixed part of the URL in front of the editable path. |
| `teams` | `NewProjectTeam[]` | `sampleNewProjectTeams` | `{ value, label, plan? }`; `plan` is `{ name, used, limit? }` and drives the plan card (leave `limit` out for no limit, 12 or fewer draw one segment per project). A team at its limit can't continue. |
| `visibilityOptions` | `NewProjectOption[]` | Private / Public | `{ value, label, description? }`, one radio row each. |
