- Projects created in the form count against the team's plan: after one, the meter fills the next segment and "Create another" may hit the limit (the meter turns amber at the limit).
- Re-skin it through the CSS variables on the form: `--np-surface`, `--np-sunken`, `--np-raised`, `--np-selected`, `--np-line`, `--np-divider`, `--np-text`, `--np-text-2`, `--np-text-3`, `--np-accent`, `--np-on-accent`, `--np-radio` / `--np-radio-line` / `--np-radio-on` (a radio's inside, ring and checked ring), `--np-meter` (the meter's empty segments), `--np-ring`, `--np-danger`, `--np-success`, `--np-warning`, `--np-shadow` / `--np-menu-shadow`, e.g. `style={{ "--np-accent": "#7c9cff" } as React.CSSProperties}`. The team list portals to `<body>` and copies them when it opens.
