- Figma: the form is "Transfer sheet" (1891:100106) inside "07 — Secure Token Transfer" (1891:100105), section "Premium ($14)" on page "Page 7"; its light twin is 2713:28198. The page behind it (#0a0a0a, light #f4f5f7) is demo-only; the sheet's halftone, light beams, rings and glow are part of the block. It is `w-full max-w-[420px]`; under about 380px the gas fee moves under the token and network, and long recipient names truncate.
